shortdesc A Greek cult font from the eighties
longdesc A cult Greek font from the eighties, used at the University of
longdesc Crete, Greece. It belonged to the first TeX installation in a
longdesc Greek University and most probably the first TeX installation
longdesc that supported the Greek language.
